## M6 — Provider 認證 (`auth/`)

- [x] `auth/` 機制層:`Credential` / `Authenticator` / `VerifyResult` / `Options`(純 stdlib,不認識任何 provider)
- [x] `auth/oauth.go`:PKCE S256 + 可選 client_secret + state CSRF + single-flight refresh + 429 Retry-After 退避
- [x] `auth/device.go`:Device Authorization Grant(RFC 8628)+ OIDC discovery(https-only 驗證)
- [x] `auth/apikey.go`:`APIKeySpec` + 泛用 `APIKeyAuth`(env chain + models 端點驗證)
- [x] `auth/store.go`:FileStore(0700 目錄 / 0600 檔 / atomic temp+rename)
- [x] `auth/provider/{anthropic,openai,google,xai,antigravity,vertex}`:6 個 provider 包,只 import `auth`
- [x] `auth/provider/provider.go`:`ROUTES` registry + `New` / `Login` / `For` / `IDs`(9 個 provider id)
- [x] `auth/authtest/`:共用測試假 provider(給 `auth` 與各 provider 包)
- [x] `cmd/auth/`:單一 `login --provider <id>` + list / verify / refresh / logout
- [x] e2e:假 provider(models 端點 + 驗簽的 Google STS)跑通 login → list → verify → refresh → logout
- [x] e2e:xAI device flow 對真實 `auth.x.ai` 跑通 OIDC discovery + device code 發放
- [x] 到期自動 refresh:`config.NewRefreshingProvider` 於每次呼叫前經 `auth.Resolver` 檢查到期並自動換發(token rotation 時重建 inner provider)

